# Secrets and local configuration
.env
.env.local

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Crawl artifacts. Committed deliberately when they are part of a frozen
# evaluation corpus (eval/ground_truth/), ignored everywhere else so that
# ad-hoc crawls do not end up in review.
# Crawl artifacts are scratch by default: they are large, regenerable, and a
# working directory fills with them.
#
# EXCEPT the ones a ground-truth file cites. docs/ground-truth.md §1 requires
# the frozen artifact to be committed alongside its pairs, and §1 explains why:
# a reference answer without its corpus is unfalsifiable -- nobody can tell
# later whether the answer was wrong or the corpus moved underneath it. Those
# are force-added, and CI fails without them, which is how this rule was found.
/prospect_*.json
!/prospect_thoughtbot_com.json

# Debugging leftovers from the ingest.py hardening session (ADR-0010).
ingest.py.bak*

# Editor and OS
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/

# Local tooling state. Auto-generated, machine-specific, contains absolute
# paths to the operator's home directory.
.atl/

# The original project brief. Ignored so it is not republished; note that
# removing it from the index does NOT remove it from history.
SCAFFOLD_PROMPT.md
